    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d800">

                <pb facs="0834" n="826" sameAs="frus:frus1938v01/pg826"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.48 Refugees/908a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in the United
                        Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Kennedy</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-11-16T19:00:00-05:00">November 16, 1938—7
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>707. For Rublee. Department’s 705, November 16, noon, and your 1320 November 16,
                    4 p.m.<anchor n="55" xml:id="d800-f1"/> In view of the announcement to the
                    press, <pb facs="0835" n="827" xml:id="pg827"/> we suggest that the meeting be
                    called for November 28 or 29. We also suggest that both the Brazilian and the
                    Argentine be invited to attend.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
